{"name":"Lovable","hex":"#c87570","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"lovable","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Inspiring or deserving love or affection; adorable or cute."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/lovable"}],"entries":[{"title":"Jill Corey","blocks":[{"text":"Jill Corey was an American popular standards singer. She was discovered and signed on one day when she was 17. She went on to have her own radio shows and to star in a feature film."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ef/Jill_Corey_1955.JPG/330px-Jill_Corey_1955.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jill_Corey"},{"title":"This Is What the Truth Feels Like","blocks":[{"text":"This Is What the Truth Feels Like is the third studio album by American singer Gwen Stefani. It was released on March 18, 2016, by Interscope Records. Initially, the album was scheduled to be released in December 2014 with Stefani working with a handful of high-profile producers, and Benny Blanco serving as executive producer. However, after the underperformance of her 2014 singles and the writer's block Stefani suffered, she did not feel comfortable curating an album and scrapped the whole record in favor of starting again. The album's release was scheduled after Stefani hinted at it on her Twitter account."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/3/3f/Gwen_Stefani_-_This_Is_What_the_Truth_Feels_Like_%28Official_Album_Cover%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/This_Is_What_the_Truth_Feels_Like"},{"title":"Lovable (company)","blocks":[{"text":"Lovable is a Swedish vibe coding platform and company. Founded in Stockholm in 2023, it provides software that allows users to enter prompts to automate software development."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b